        "html": "=\n<h2>Incomplete Loan Application</h2>\n\n<p>A loan application requires additional information before it can proceed to AI-assisted screening.</p>\n\n\n<p><strong>Application ID:</strong>\n{{ $('Validate and Calculate Loan Metrics').first().json.application_id }}</p>\n\n\n<p><strong>Business name:</strong>\n{{ $json.business_name || 'Not provided' }}</p>\n\n<p><strong>Monthly revenue:</strong>\n{{ $json.monthly_revenue || 'Not provided' }}</p>\n\n<p><strong>Requested loan amount:</strong>\n{{ $json.requested_loan_amount || 'Not provided' }}</p>\n\n<p><strong>Validation issues:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>{{ $json.validation_errors.join('</li><li>') }}</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Please obtain the missing or corrected information before resubmitting the application.</p>\n",
